        dat('the law as a study text a DATA row (Tosefta Sanhedrin 14:1 — never was, never will be); the capital court\'s end a DATA row (the_capital_courts_end — a clock datum: forty years before the destruction); the exam\'s person the one who examines the law and takes a reward — accepted')
        return out("the law as a study text (13:13-19) — a condemned city never was and never will be: examine and take a reward (Tosefta Sanhedrin 14:1); a city with one mezuzah never one (Sanhedrin 71a:17, 113a:3); the capital court's end forty years before the destruction (41a:25 — a clock datum): the one who examines the law and takes a reward accepted", ['accepted'])
