        ink('13:1-19', 'nineteen verses, nineteen rows — one per verse; THE CHAPTER IS LAW FROM ITS FIRST WORD TO ITS LAST — no imperative, the seducers\' "we" the only first persons plural %s, the one narrative verb %s, no divine frame, Israel once (13:12), Moses never; the register singular but for the prophet\'s case and the header %s' % (sorted(CP1), WAYY, (SG_ONLY, PL_ONLY, BOTH)))
